# Module: submit_modal
Compile unit for the Forum Frontend.
Generates: `frontend/src/components/submit_modal.tsx` (current hand-authored code is the reference output)

## Behavior
- Field A: Feature Title — max 60 chars, single line, live character countdown (warns when low).
- Field B: Functional Scope — max 300 chars, multi-line, live countdown; reject under 30 chars with copy nudging precise, implementation-first behaviors over sweeping epics.
- Shows the coin cost: "Costs 1 🪙 · N left today"; submit button "🔥 Pitch it (1 🪙)".
- On submit: call `api_client.createFeature`; on `202`, close and let the shell show the screening toast + pending entry (author-only). On `429`: "You've hit 5 pitches this hour — take a breather" style copy and disabled submit.
- Validation errors render inline, friendly, verbatim-displayable; never raw error detail.
- Dialog a11y: `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal`, labelled title, backdrop click + ✕ to close, autofocus on Field A.

